    "number": 36686,
    "state": "open",
    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "test: cover cumulative input value range in CheckTxInput tests.",
    "user": {
      "login": "KY-U",
      "id": 90665609,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjY1NjA5",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90665609?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/KY-U",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "In `Consensus::CheckTxInputs`, for every input coin, if either `coin.out.nValue` or `nValueIn` is out of range, the transaction is invalid. The current `checktxinputs_invalid_transactions_test` only cover cases with one input, so the sum `nValueIn` is always equal to `coin.out.nValue`, leaving the [following mutant](https://mutanthub.space/mutants/275) alive.\r\n```diff\r\n--- a/src/consensus/tx_verify.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/consensus/tx_verify.cpp\r\n@@ -189,7 +189,7 @@ bool Consensus::CheckTxInputs(const CTransaction& tx, TxValidationState& state,\r\n \r\n         // Check for negative or overflow input values\r\n         nValueIn += coin.out.nValue;\r\n-        if (!MoneyRange(coin.out.nValue) || !MoneyRange(nValueIn)) {\r\n+        if (!MoneyRange(coin.out.nValue) && !MoneyRange(nValueIn)) {\r\n             return state.Invalid(TxValidationResult::TX_CONSENSUS, \"bad-txns-inputvalues-outofrange\");\r\n         }\r\n     }\r\n```\r\nhttps://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36686/commits/f8c6cd84e08043f206ca338d0ba7e4dc8bef5214 adds support for multiple inputs in the test helper.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36686/commits/5d93087c6abbda758baf3d49c552e6dc259d5021 adds a test case with multiple valid inputs, whose sum exceed `MAX_MONEY`, while also having `nValueIn` != `coin.out.nValue`, killing the mutant.",
